 "strings": {
  "Sure, but... you'll talk to him\neither way, right?": "",
  "All the same. I'd appreciate it\nif you'd stop barking orders at me.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Club Amour. This is where everything went down\nbetween Hamura and Kume...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The angle of the footage should help me find\nwhere the camera is.)</color>": "",
  "We've gotta find out what happened when Hamura\nand Kume were alone in Amour.": "",
  "We've gotta find out what happened when Hamura and\nKume were alone. Go talk to the owner of Amour.": "",
  "I'm counting on you.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Found it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is the security camera\nthat gave us our footage.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(...Better go talk to the owner of Amour.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There's supposed to be a camera\nout front... but where?)</color>": "",
  "Hm? Who are you?\nYou need something?": "",
  "Hm? Hey, who are you?\nWhat do you want?": "",
  "Actually, I was wondering\nif you have a minute to talk.": "",
  "Actually, I was just hoping to talk.\nGot a second?": "",
  "About December 3rd.": "",
  "What happened here\non December 3rd?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The security camera wouldn't have been able to\ntake that footage from this position. I need to look closer.)</color>": "",
  "(The security camera wouldn't have been able to\ntake that footage from this position. I need to look closer.)": "",
  "Oh, I had that day off, man. If anyone's gonna know,\nit's our manager. He doesn't come in 'til nighttime, though.": "",
  "Oh, I had that day off so I don't have a clue.\nOur manager would know... but he's only here at night.": "",
  "The manager, huh?": "",
  "This him?": "",
  "Is this him?": "",
  "Oh, it is!": "",
  "Oh, yup!": "",
  "What's his name?": "",
  "Aragaki.": "",
  "Think you could get in touch with him\nfor me? We need to have a chat.": "",
  "Think you could call him? We need to have a chat.\nIt won't be long.": "",
  "I could try. Hold on.": "",
  "I could try? Hold on.": "",
  "I knew this was gonna happen.\nHe never has his phone on during the day.": "",
  "He usually hangs out near here, though.": "",
  "He usually hangs out\nnear here, though.": "",
  "You mean in Kamurocho?": "",
  "Yup. Usually.": "",
  "Usually.": "",
  "All right, I'll go take a look around.": "",
  "If you don't mind me asking... how?\nYou're just gonna walk the whole city?": "",
  "If you don't mind me asking... how?\nYou're gonna walk the whole city?": "",
  "Nah, I have a plan.\nSomeone I can use to help me find him.": "",
  "Nah, I've got a plan to find him.\nI know someone who can help me out.": "",
  "With a name and photo,\nit shouldn't be much of a problem.": "",
  "As long as I've got a name and a photo\nto work from, I'll be fine.": "",
  "Huh, if you say so, man.\nGood luck.": "",
  "Huh... Sounds like a real hotshot.\nGood luck.": "",
  "Thanks for the help.": "",
  "Thanks. You've been a big help.": "",
  "(Oh yeah, there's supposed to be a back door, too.\nHamura said that's where he left from.)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So this is the back of the club.)</color>": "",
  "(So this is the back of the club.)": "",
  "(Camera's definitely broken. No way to tell\nwho came through here.)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Oh! It's a security camera.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Oh wait, it's broken? Damn.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The night of the crime, Hamura said he and Kume\nleft the club from this door.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This camera would've caught that\nif it had been working.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(As for where the owner is...\nI know just the person to ask.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I have a feeling he'll be where he always is:\nMantai Internet Café.)</color>": "",
  "Somehow I knew I'd find you here.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-shi. You here to join\nthis raid I'm about to get going?": "",
  "Oh. If it isn't Yagami-shi. Then...\nare you here to play a game with me?": "",
  "Probably not, huh.\nWhat can I do for you?": "",
  "...Well, I thought I'd at least ask.\nWhat's up?": "",
  "Got something I need a guy like you for, Tsukumo.": "",
  "Got something I need\na hand with, Tsukumo.": "",
  "This is Makoto Tsukumo.\nHe's... Well, he's a character.": "",
  "This is Makoto Tsukumo.\nWeird name for a weird guy.": "",
  "Tsukumo makes a living digging up dirt on\nthe internet. A modern-day informant, if you will.": "",
  "Tsukumo makes a living digging up dirt on the internet.\nIn other words, a modern-day informant.": "",
  "He was a pretty serious shut-in when we first met, but I got to\nknow him better after I helped him through some family trouble.": "",
  "He can at least leave his house now, but he still\nends up spending all his time in this internet café...": "",
  "More detective work, I assume?": "",
  "Let me guess.\nMore detective work?": "",
  "What's the mark this time?\nA lost cat? Someone go missing?": "",
  "You looking for a lost cat again?\nOr maybe it's a person this time?": "",
  "I'm looking for someone.\nThe owner of Club Amour, man named Aragaki.": "",
  "I'm trying to find someone. The owner of Club Amour,\na man named Aragaki.": "",
  "He's probably somewhere nearby, but I don't\nhave time to scour all of Kamurocho either.": "",
  "He's probably in the city somewhere, but I don't\nhave time to scour Kamurocho for him.": "",
  "You've got that right.\nSearching on foot's for cave men.": "",
  "You've got that right.\nSearching on foot's sooo outdated.": "",
  "Here, can I see your phone\nfor a quick second?": "",
  "Here, can I see your phone\nfor a second?": "",
  "I was hoping you'd say that.": "",
  "My phone? Sure.": "",
  "Hmmm? What do we have here?": "",
  "Well. Well, well, well.": "",
  "...What?": "",
  "You already have the Chatter app, Yagami-shi!": "",
  "Yagami-shi! You've already got\nthe Chatter app! ": "",
  "I do? Oh.\nGuess it came preinstalled.": "",
  "Chatter? Huh. Guess it came preinstalled.": "",
  "Well you're in luck. In my hands, this stupid app\nbecomes a powerful way to find people!": "",
  "Well, that means you're in luck. In my hands,\nthis simple app becomes a powerful tracking tool!": "",
  "Really? How?": "",
  "Hold on.\nI'm busting into their servers now.": "",
  "I'm breaking into their servers now,\nhold on a sec...": "",
  "Annnnd there we go.\nHere, take a look.": "",
  "That should do it...\nYagami-shi, take a look.": "",
  "GPS... You mean the location info?": "",
  "Go ahead, try searching\nfor something. Maybe a name?": "",
  "We'll need a keyword to put in the search terms.\nDo you have a name to give me?": "",
  "That would be Aragaki.": "",
  "Yeah: Aragaki.": "",
  "Okay, and let's limit the time period\nwhile we're at it. Say, today.": "",
  "Next, we should narrow the results.\nHow about... within the day?": "",
  "Search period?": "",
  "See? That map'll tell you the GPS\nposition of all the relevant Chatter posts.": "",
  "There. See the map? It tells you the GPS position\nof all the relevant Chatter posts.": "",
  "Not gonna lie, I had to give myself admin\nprivileges to get that one though! Hehe!": "",
  "Though I had to give myself admin privileges\nfor that, though! Hehe!": "",
  "Wow.": "",
  "Wait, so you mean you hacked in?": "",
  "Hmmmm, 128 hits. We're gonna need\nto narrow down the search.": "",
  "Hmmmm, we got about 128 hits... We're gonna\nneed to narrow down the search.": "",
  "Not sure what else we can put in, though.": "",
  "But we need more terms...": "",
  "Didn't you say the name of the club,\nYagami-shi? Some crazy French word?": "",
  "Well, any related terms could be useful here.\nYagami-shi, didn't you say the name of the club?": "",
  "Oh yeah. It's Club Amour.": "",
  "It's Club Amour in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Great. Let's try \"Aragaki\" and \"Club Amour\".": "",
  "So... \"Aragaki\" and \"Club Amour\"\nmight work out.": "",
  "Well looky there!\nNarrowed it down to one.": "",
  "Well, looky there!\nNarrowed it down to one.": "",
  "So, Aragaki wrote this, huh?": "",
  "Nope! Just someone who saw him.\nThat's still a massive hint, though.": "",
  "No, no! It's just someone who saw him.\nOf course, that's still a massive hint, though.": "",
  "So, how are we supposed to use it?": "",
  "See, it got posted only 10 minutes ago,\nmeaning the poster might still be nearby.": "",
  "See that time marker? It got posted only ten minutes ago.\nMeaning the poster might still be nearby.": "",
  "So if I were you... I'd get down there\nand see if you can find out where your man went.": "",
  "That way, you can head right over there.\nAsk them where Aragaki went, and follow the trail.": "",
  "Great. I'll go check it out now.": "",
  "Really? Great, I'll go check it out.": "",
  "I marked the spot on your map, Yagami-shi.\nHope it comes in handy. Good luck out there.": "",
  "Yagami-shi, you can reference your map app. I marked\ntheir location on it. Hope it comes in handy.": "",
  "Appreciate it.\nOh, and try to get out more, okay?": "",
  "Great. I appreciate it. Oh, and try to\nget out more, okay?": "",
  "Why on earth would I do that?": "",
  "Hehe! Why would I ever leave?": "",
  "Got a second?": "",
  "Sure, I can spare a few of those.\nWhat's up?": "",
  "Huh? Yagami-san, right? What's up?": "",
  "I'm looking for the owner of a club\ncalled Amour. Any idea where he is?": "",
  "Actually, yeah. Just saw him.\nWasn't in a great mood from the look of it.": "",
  "Actually, I just saw him.\nWasn't in a great mood from the look of it.": "",
  "Must've really lost big time\non the pachinko slots.": "",
  "Must've really lost big time\nin pachinko.": "",
  "Any idea where he was heading?": "",
  "So? Where was he heading?": "",
  "Toward Taihei Boulevard.\nProbably getting sushi, if I had to guess.": "",
  "Toward Taihei Boulevard. \nProbably getting sushi, if I had to guess.": "",
  "Sushi? Really? Isn't that a little pricey\nfor a guy who just lost a buncha money?": "",
  "Huh? Sushi? After losing money in pachinko?\nThat's a pretty pricey meal...": "",
  "You don't get it. You get sushi after\na big loss to cheer yourself up.": "",
  "You don't get it! You get sushi after\na big loss to cheer yourself up.": "",
  "What's ten more grand if you've\nalready lost fifty or a hundred?": "",
  "If you've already lost fifty or a hundred,\nis ten more grand really gonna set you back?": "",
  "Winning's what makes you stingy. Feels like it'd be\na waste to blow your earnings on something dumb.": "",
  "Then when you win, that's what makes you stingy.\nCan't just blow your winnings on food.": "",
  "Huh, I'd never thought about it.": "",
  "...Huh. If you say so.": "",
  "Anyway, thanks a bunch.\nI'll head over to that sushi joint.": "",
  "Well, I'll head over to that sushi joint on Taihei Boulevard.\nYou're a big help. Thanks!": "",
  "Your man went toward Taihei Boulevard.\nProbably grabbing sushi or something.": "",
  "Your guy from Amour went toward Taihei Boulevard.\nProbably grabbing sushi or something.": "",
  "See you next time!": "",
  "Aragaki-san? The owner of Amour?": "",
  "...And you are?": "",
  "Yagami from the Yagami Detective Agency. I wanna talk\nabout what happened on the night of December 3rd.": "",
  "Yagami from the Yagami Detective Agency.\nI wanna talk about the night of December 3rd.": "",
  "Oh, yeah?\nSorry, not ringing any bells.": "",
  "Huh, really? Well, doesn't ring a bell.\nSorry.": "",
  "Come on.\nYou and I both know that's not true.": "",
  "You and I both know that's not true.": "",
  "Well it is.\nI don't know a damn thing.": "",
  "Really, I don't know a damn thing.": "",
  "Why don't I jog your memory then?\nI've got something to show you.": "",
  "I could always show you proof.\nMaybe that'd jog your memory a little.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What evidence do I have that shows\nhe's related to the incident?)</color>": "",
  "Take a look.": "",
  "Here.": "",
  "On the night of the crime,\nyou left Amour with these Matsugane goons.": "",
  "On the night of the crime, you left Amour\nwith these Matsugane goons.": "",
  "Leaving Hamura and Kume,\nthe victim, alone in there.": "",
  "You left the scene with Hamura \nand the victim, Kume, alone in there.": "",
  "You're knee deep in this.": "",
  "Guess I can't argue with that logic.": "",
  "Seriously...? Fine, okay.": "",
  "Don't worry,\nI won't ask for anything too out there.": "",
  "I won't ask for anything too much.": "",
  "Just a bit of your time. I'm working on Hamura's defense,\nand I'm hoping you're the silver bullet.": "",
  "I'm working on Hamura's defense for this case.\nI just need a little of your time.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Whatever, I'll talk.": "",
  "Oh, this the one out back?": "",
  "That's... Oh, the one out back?\nAt Amour?": "",
  "There's no point in having\na security camera if it doesn't even work.": "",
  "Why keep a security camera\nif it doesn't even work?": "",
  "Sure, I should've replaced it...\nBut I dunno how that proves I was involved.": "",
  "Sure, fair point... but I dunno how that\nproves I was involved.": "",
  "Oh, huh. I guess you're right.": "",
  "Well, what about this, then?": "",
  "Hm? How's this show that\nI was involved in the incident?": "",
  "Hm? What is this? How's this show\nI was involved in the incident?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Oh... This footage doesn't actually show\nthe owner of Amour.)</color>": "",
  "Huh, you actually tracked him down.": "",
  "Appreciate the help.": "",
  "Now, what went down around 9 PM\non the night of December 3rd?": "",
  "Well, uh... Captain Hamura brought\nthat Kansai punk, Kume, in here.": "",
  "Well... Captain Hamura dropped by.\nHe dragged that Kansai punk, Kume, in here.": "",
  "Was out of the blue.\nCaught me off guard.": "",
  "Completely out of the blue.\nCaught me off guard.": "",
  "Were there any other\ncustomers here at the time?": "",
  "At the time, were there\nany customers?": "",
  "Just a few. They bailed when Hamura\ncame busting in here. Who wouldn't?": "",
  "Only three or four. But once the yakuza\nbusted in, everyone took off.": "",
  "I ended up sending the girls home, too.": "",
  "Mhm.": "",
  "Once everybody was gone... The Matsugane guys\njust laid into Kume. For almost an hour.": "",
  "Once the guests left... the Matsugane guys\njust laid into Kume. For almost an hour.": "",
  "You, uh, didn't hear that from me.": "",
  "Though... you didn't hear that\nfrom me, okay?": "",
  "You're good, don't worry.": "",
  "Then right around 10,\nsomething kinda weird happened.": "",
  "Then, right around 10,\nsomething kinda weird happened.": "",
  "Hamura kicked everyone\nout of the club. Even me.": "",
  "Hamura kicked everyone out\nof the club. Even me.": "",
  "So nobody knew exactly\nwhat was going on here then?": "",
  "That's what was going on here, then?": "",
  "Pretty much.": "",
  "And the only ones left\ninside were Hamura and Kume...": "",
  "And the only ones left inside\nwere Hamura and Kume.": "",
  "You know why Hamura kicked everyone out?": "",
  "You know why Captain Hamura\nkicked everyone out?": "",
  "He... He said Kume reminded him of an old friend.\nClaimed they needed to have a chat, alone.": "",
  "Well... He said Kume reminded him of an old friend.\nClaimed they needed to have a chat, alone.": "",
  "At least, that's how he worded it.": "",
  "That's how he worded it.": "",
  "And that didn't seem weird to anyone?": "",
  "And that didn't seem weird\nto anyone?": "",
  "Oh the Matsugane boys had\nplenty to say about it.": "",
  "Oh, the Matsugane boys had\nplenty to say about it.": "",
  "But if the boss tells you to leave,\nyou get the heck out.": "",
  "But if the boss tells you to leave,\nyou fucking leave.": "",
  "No clue what went down\nin the club after that.": "",
  "And after that?\nI don't know what went down.": "",
  "Tell me about the camera out back.\nThe broken one.": "",
  "Tell me about the camera out back.\nIt's broken, right?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I'm counting on you.": "ฝากด้วยนะ",
  "What's his name?": "เขาชื่ออะไรล่ะ?",
  "Thanks for the help.": "ขอบคุณที่ช่วยนะ",
  "...What?": "...ว่าไงนะ?",
  "Wow.": "โห",
  "See you next time!": "แล้วเจอกันครั้งหน้านะคะ!",
  "Take a look.": "ดูนี่สิ",
  "Here.": "เอานี่สิ",
  "Mhm.": "อือ.",
  "Pretty much.": "ก็ประมาณนั้นแหละ"
 }
}
